  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Batys Transit Power Supply Project, through Government of Kazakhstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $744,450 grant to the &quot;Batys Transit&quot; joint stock company (BTTR) supports a feasibility study (FS) on a gas-fired power plant project of 25-100 megawatts of generation capacity in northwest Kazakhstan. In addition, the study is evaluating renewable power generation opportunities. The project would reduce BTTR&apos;s current purchasing of grid power to replace lost lines and potentially provide additional power to the grid in the underserved Aktobe province of Kazakhstan.</narrative>
  </description>
